# cards: later kills recharge an owned card (docs/plan-cards.md 2.6, point 7). As test_card_first_win, with the
# Bealzebub card (227) already in the bag at 100 points (0x020B489A). Expect: after the win its points rise by 100 per
# Bealzebub killed (capped at 900), and the count stays 1. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213ba12 1
poke u16 0x020b489a 100
wait 270
watch u8 0x0213ba12 bealzebub_cards
watch u16 0x020b489a bealzebub_points
watch u8 0x0213ba25 thanatos_cards
watch u16 0x020b48c0 thanatos_points
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
